    "For instance, if you were born on April 10, your half-birthday falls on October 10.",
    "For instance, if you were born on March 15, your half-birthday is September 15.",
    "In those cases, the half-birthday falls on the last valid day of the month: February 28 or February 29 in a leap year.",
